### Katalog endpoint
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/

### Home (fan-out)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/home

### Manga list
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/manga/list?page=1&page_size=10&sort=latest&sort_order=desc

### Manga list + filter format & genre
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/manga/list?format=manhwa&genre_include=action&is_update=true

### Top daily
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/manga/top?filter=daily

### Manga detail (ganti {manga_id})
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/manga/{manga_id}

### Chapter meta
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/manga/{manga_id}/chapters

### Chapter detail + images (ganti {chapter_id})
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/chapter/{chapter_id}

### Taxonomies
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/genres
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/types
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/formats

### People
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/authors?q=a
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/artists?q=a

### Misc
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/announcements?page=1&page_size=10
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/slider
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/search?q=solo
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/explore
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/random

### Error mapping
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/manga/top?filter=hourly
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/manga/does-not-exist
